{"id":"vod_sn_38024","vodId":"38024","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"雏子的笔记","name_cn":"雏子的笔记","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/259c3f4bfde171b9b1182867d7ee0ac9.jpg"},"summary":"樱木雏子（市道真央 配音）是一个个性十分内向和害羞的女孩，然而，她的心中却怀揣着成为一名戏剧演员的梦想。为了实现自己的梦想，雏子决定推自己一把，离开了熟悉的故乡，前往首都，她希望在那里能够结识到新的朋友，磨练自己与他人交往的能力。　　雏子住进了名为四季庄的宿舍里，让雏子没有想到的是，这里竟然是一家旧书店。在四季庄，雏子认识了很多朋友——个性开朗乐观喜欢吃书的奇怪少女夏川久依奈（富田美忧 配音）、平日里沉默寡言但一旦站在舞台之上就能够口若悬河的荻野千秋（东城日沙子 配音）、外表娇小可爱却一直十分努力的生活着的柊真雪（小仓唯 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:57:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/32nhzvA4Ta1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JykkmnG6FE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LYMunWzxrM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pdJBJr2hC01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G89DJcLKpE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kLKDqxixgQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0cu44Cegwf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VXBGwjkb901/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jyWJ1r0TBe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LKGYfxFL2n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7MFsfR8FmK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ee1MtE8DCR1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:03.762Z"}